Reviewed against patch 2.1.67 on 2026-05-13. The live patch is 2.2.16a, so these have not been re-read against it yet.

### EXP Sustain Default (EXP)

- Items: Tough Boots, War Axe, Hunter Strike, Queen's Wings, Dominance Ice, Immortality
- Core: War Axe, Hunter Strike, Queen's Wings
- Emblem: Fighter Emblem with Firmness, Festival of Blood, Brave Smite
- Battle spell: Flicker
- Flex: Warrior Boots over Tough Boots when Use into physical EXP lanes when the enemy control chain is light enough to skip Fortitude.; Oracle over Dominance Ice when Use when anti-heal is already covered and extra shield plus HP regen value lets Great Sword trades last longer.; Athena's Shield over Dominance Ice when Use when burst magic can remove you before Queen's Wings and Bravery Blessing can stabilize the entry.; Sea Halberd over Dominance Ice when Use when your team needs damage-applied Lifebane into high-HP sustain targets instead of a defensive aura.
- Total cost: 11190 gold

Default EXP setup for ranked games where Lapu-Lapu needs War Axe stacking, Hunter Strike chase tempo, and Queen's Wings to finish Great Sword windows.

### EXP Vengeance Frontline (EXP)

- Items: Tough Boots, War Axe, Queen's Wings, Brute Force Breastplate, Oracle, Immortality
- Core: War Axe, Queen's Wings, Brute Force Breastplate
- Emblem: Fighter Emblem with Firmness, Festival of Blood, Brave Smite
- Battle spell: Vengeance
- Flex: Dominance Ice over Oracle when Use when enemy shield, HP regen, or attack-speed carries must hit you during the first dive.; Antique Cuirass over Oracle when Use against repeated physical skill burst from fighters or assassins that meet you before Raging Slash finishes.; Radiant Armor over Oracle when Use against repeated magic damage that stacks across long Turtle, Lord, or base fights.; Blade Armor over Oracle when Use when a basic-attack carry is forced to hit you before reaching your back line.
- Total cost: 10900 gold

Durable EXP setup for drafts where Lapu-Lapu must take first contact, press Vengeance, and buy enough time for allied damage to follow.

### Jungle Tempo Bruiser (Jungle)

- Items: Tough Boots, War Axe, Hunter Strike, Queen's Wings, Malefic Roar, Immortality
- Core: War Axe, Hunter Strike, Queen's Wings
- Emblem: Fighter Emblem with Firmness, Seasoned Hunter, Brave Smite
- Battle spell: Retribution
- Blessing: Ice Retribution
- Flex: Warrior Boots over Tough Boots when Use when early jungle fights are mostly physical and crowd control is not deciding the first objective.; Brute Force Breastplate over Malefic Roar when Use when movement speed, cooldown reduction, and control-duration reduction matter more than armor penetration.; Sea Halberd over Malefic Roar when Use when the enemy front line relies on HP regen or shields and has not stacked enough Physical Defense to demand Malefic Roar.; Athena's Shield over Immortality when Use when burst magic threatens the first dive before the revive can create real value.
- Total cost: 11240 gold

Jungle setup for teams that want Lapu-Lapu to farm level four quickly, use Ice Retribution to stay attached, and still scale into bruiser teamfights.

